            <div xml:id="d303">

                <pb facs="0513" n="399" sameAs="frus:frus1922v02/pg399"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">125.655/35: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at London</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Skinner</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-11-06T16:00:00+00:00"><hi rendition="#italic">November 6,
                                1922—4 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received November 6—2:26
                        p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>From Johnson:</p>
                <p>I returned from Newcastle where I found nothing to change view expressed in my
                    message transmitted by Embassy on October 6. Sailing 9th <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >President Harding.</hi></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Skinner</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
